WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:05.590
Coby is speed-running through the Marine ranks
and might end up as admiral orange crab at

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:08.780
the end of the story, wielding the Mera-Mera
no mi.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:14.700
There are very few characters I have changed
my mind about as drastically as with Koby,

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:21.000
the little annoying pink-haired harry-potter-glasses
Koby, that we got to meet at the very beginning

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.710
of the story.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:32.189
When I first started getting into One Piece,
he was pretty damn annoying to me, I'm not

00:00:32.189 --> 00:00:33.189
gonna lie.

00:00:33.189 --> 00:00:39.469
I was here for pirates and epic fights and
wanted to see Luffy and Zoro beat people up.

00:00:39.469 --> 00:00:43.560
The few episodes with Coby were enough for
me.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:50.289
Jump forward a few episodes, more, no like
a few hundred episodes, what?

00:00:50.289 --> 00:00:52.019
A THOUSAND?

00:00:52.019 --> 00:00:53.019
Holy hell.

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:55.100
It's like someone accidentally left the printer
on.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:01:00.389
Anyways, nowadays my opinion on Koby has done
a full 180 degree turn.

00:01:00.389 --> 00:01:06.430
To me in a way he is the embodiment of great
writing in One Piece and one of the most quickly

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:10.392
growing characters in the story, and I guess
it took some time for me to grow as well as

00:01:10.392 --> 00:01:12.960
a person to realize that.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:17.660
Hi my name is Manu, thanks to you guys I'm
at that level where YouTubers start saying

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:24.670
stupid shit, so I don't know, if this video
gets a million views in the first week, I

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:28.920
will dye my hair pink *laughs uncontrollably*
you become what you hate the most I guess

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:35.480
- like you know how people really hate on
something, like writing shit on t-shirts hate,

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:37.770
but then end up doing it themselves?

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:40.420
That's me, but with Youtubers.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:42.611
I completely lost my thread here.

00:01:42.611 --> 00:01:45.040
*tries to calm down* One Piece.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:50.460
Today I want to talk about Koby's very unique
role in the story, what his encounter with

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:56.350
Boa Hancock probably means for Luffy, and
of course, you know the drill, a crazy theory

00:01:56.350 --> 00:02:03.000
about how Koby will become Marine Admiral
Orange Crab, inheriting Ace's and Sabo's Mega

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.040
Mera no mi.

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.980
Yes another dead brother.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:06.980
I know.

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:11.810
Koby's role in the story is one of the most
interesting and creative ones in One Piece,

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:13.980
which really says something.

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:19.060
At first glance, it might be easy to think
that Coby is supposed to be to Luffy, what

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:26.000
Garp was to Roger, a rival and foil in the
marines.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:34.640
However, Coby has neither the power, nor the
necessary presence in the story to fill that

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:35.640
role.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:40.430
Much rather it is Smoker, who chases Luffy
from Island to Island and slowly but steadily

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:44.600
forms a bond with him, such as Garp and Roger
did.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:51.570
To me personally Coby's relationship to Luffy
is much closer to the one Luffy has with Shanks.

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:55.930
He was the one who inspired Luffy to follow
his dream and even though Luffy never really

00:02:55.930 --> 00:03:07.599
gets to see Shanks, he keeps chasing after
him and catching up in strength and experience.

00:03:07.599 --> 00:03:10.370
And the way I see it, it's the same for Coby.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:14.780
Luffy was the one who inspired him to follow
his dream to become a marine and even though

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:19.920
he barely ever sees Luffy, he strives to catch
up to him as fast as he can.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:25.849
He is the first an maybe most important example
of Luffy's unique ability to make allies and

00:03:25.849 --> 00:03:30.260
friends wherever he goes and bringing out
the best in people.

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:36.410
With Luffy by his side, Coby goes from the
small, plump and cowardly boy to a full-blown

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:41.500
Marine Captian, with Haki and Rokushiki powers
in just 2 years.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:47.560
He is still far behind Luffy, but considering
that Luffy has been training his entire life

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:55.230
with Garp and Ace and Sabo, I think it's more
than impressive how fast Coby has developed.

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:59.850
He starts as a people pleaser with little
self-value on Aida's ship, which is of course

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:04.129
understandable if you want to survive, who
is too scared to step out of his comfort zone

00:04:04.129 --> 00:04:08.120
to actually chase his dream.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:17.780
Inspired by Luffy's confidence he finally
awakens his inner flame of courage and decides

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:21.650
to take the necessary step to turn his life
around.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:27.570
Essentially Coby stops making excuses and
starts taking things into his own hands, accepting

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:31.220
the risk that he might fail or be rejected.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:35.850
Under Garp's special training and following
Luffy's quick rise in the pirate world, even

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:42.190
though he still is undeniably Coby, every
time we see him he has more and more confidence

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:43.190
and power.

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:47.870
He still cries a lot, but it's completely
different, because instead of self-pity and

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:54.530
cowardness he now is a man that simply embraces
his emotional side and is as caring and kind

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:56.820
to people as any straw hat.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:05:03.150
Again, in true Luffy-fashion, his new big
dream is to become a marine admiral, mirroring

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:10.910
Luffy's dream to become pirate king.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:18.690
Luffy inspires Coby that anything is possible.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:22.660
Marineford then is a true milestone in his
development.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:28.770
The moment he was determined enough to step
in front of Akainu the coldest and most unforgiving

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:34.490
Marine out there, well-knowing that it will
probably cost him his life, but with 0 regrets,

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:40.110
was when Coby gained 20.000 extra respect
points in my book and in yours probably as

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.110
well.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:46.610
Just like Luffy, he is now prepared to embrace
his values and ideals and life for them.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:52.479
In that moment he is the ultimate contrast
to the cruel war-mongering of Akainu and shows

00:05:52.479 --> 00:05:57.040
us what the Marines could and let's be real,
should be like.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:03.919
Something for which he even earns the respect
of Shanks himself.

00:06:03.919 --> 00:06:12.220
He keeps rising through the ranks and now
is holding the 6th highest position in the

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:16.540
countless Marine ranks, taking on more and
more important tasks.

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:20.630
Not only is he now on his way to fight the
former warlord Boa Hancock, but he also is

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:26.690
part of the secret Marine organisation sword,
that actively is fighting to free the Marines

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:28.860
form the hand of the corrupt world government.

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:35.530
So to my eyes at least, Oda is clearly building
Coby up to play an important role in the story.

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:40.729
On the one hand he shows us how great and
special a person Luffy truly is, throwing

00:06:40.729 --> 00:06:47.180
out seeds of friendship with a future top-marine
in the second chapter of the story.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:52.210
Coby is a personification of the effect Luffy
has on people.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:56.900
On the other hand, he is now imitating Luffy
on the Marine side, and is being set up as

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:02.820
one of the 'proper ones' that will lead the
navy on the right path once the world government

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:03.850
is taken down.

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:09.539
An absolutely fantastic supporting character
that is written very unconventionally, but

00:07:09.539 --> 00:07:12.740
that I absolutely have grown to love.

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:16.620
So, where does our pink-haired bad-boy go
from here?

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:21.620
The abolishment of the Shijibukai System was
one of the major outcomes of the Revery and

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.290
threw a lot of heavy hitters back into the
game.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:29.740
I'm super excited to see where Mihawk is going
to end up, Buggy is surely gonna run into

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:36.289
Luffy again at some point, but the most interesting
storyline right now is undoubtedly Boa Hancock's

00:07:36.289 --> 00:07:44.390
confrontation with Coby.

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:49.210
The scared kid from East Blue versus the revered
Pirate Empress.

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:54.750
Now the outcome of this battle is heavily
debated, after all, both are pretty powerful.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:59.490
Coby has shown us how much stronger he has
gotten, while hancock is even able to use

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:01.020
conquerors haki.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:07.290
But of course, the one thing that combines
this unlikely duo, is their love for Luffy.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:11.980
Hancock is the self-declared future wife of
the pirate king, while Coby is the biggest

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:18.210
member of the Luffy-fanclub, second only to
Bartolomeo maybe.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:27.509
I am more than curious to see how this fight
is going to turn out, but I am convinced that

00:08:27.509 --> 00:08:33.680
sooner or later, both of them will realise
that they are on Luffy's side.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:38.940
And I don't put it past either of them to
team up and come for Luffy's aid, maybe even

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:40.680
still in Wano.

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:45.920
However what's even more fun to think and
speculate about is whether Coby will actually

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:51.420
fulfil his big dream and become a marine admiral
by the end of the story.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:56.510
And there is a super interesting theory about
this, that exist in a number of different

00:08:56.510 --> 00:09:02.470
variations and with different twists, so it's
hard to figure out who to credit for it.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:08.250
Nonetheless it's an incredibly fun one and
makes surprisingly much sense.

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:13.600
Now as a premise for this theory, we of course
have to assume that coby WILL actually become

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:16.180
and admiral at some point.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:20.770
You could say against that, that he still
seems to have a long way to go, but then the

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:24.740
rate at which he has been growing has been
pretty damn insane.

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:29.620
Plus we don't know if there might not be another
time skip somewhere ahead of us.

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:35.070
The biggest clue however lies in the fact
that this is Coby's declared dream.

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:40.180
Coby mirrors Luffy and One Piece is a story
about dreams.

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:46.580
So while Oda could simply go and be like,
ah yeee you gonna be an admiral in the new

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:50.890
marines some day my boy and they lived happily
ever after at the end of one piece, why bring

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.300
it up in the first place?

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:59.870
So I do think that Coby will fulfil this dream,
just like the straw hats will fulfil theirs.

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:05.580
The basis of this theory is the pattern that
Oda uses to create the admirals in One Piece.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:10.690
As you know, each admiral has a color associated
with their devil fruit power, as well as an

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:11.690
animal.

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:16.720
Thus, with the original trio we have the red
dog, akainu, the blue pheasant Aokiji and

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:23.200
the yellow monkey, Kizaru.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:28.670
Later we get the purple tiger, Fujitora as
well as the green bull, Ryokugyuu.

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:31.110
Another common pattern is the number 3.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:33.610
There always 3 admirals.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:36.000
Never more and never less.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:40.100
Based on that alone it would be pretty hard
to figure out more about Coby and his future

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:41.310
in the marines.

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:46.640
However, there are actually 2 more patterns
hidden this system, that you're maybe not

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:47.870
familiar with.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:50.700
The first is the color system.

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:56.640
It might seem a bit random at first, but red,
blue and yellow are actually the 3 primary

00:10:56.640 --> 00:11:00.160
colors, that you can use to make any other
color.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:04.260
I actually love design and stuff, so I'm pretty
excited that we're talking about color theory

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.260
now.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:08.090
Now let's mix each of these primary colors
together.

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:10.260
Red and blue gives us purple.

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:12.460
Blue and Yellow gives us green.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:15.320
And Red and yellow gives us orange.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:20.060
Now Aokiji and Akainu have already been replaced
by green and purple.

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:31.940
Kizaru still remains, but following this pattern
would be replaced by an orange admiral.

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:38.710
Under the assumption that that's coby, this
would make him the orange....what exactly?

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:43.870
And you may or may not believe me, but there
actually is a pretty clear pattern to the

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:47.209
animal theme within the admirals as well.

00:11:47.209 --> 00:11:52.709
You're already familiar with the legend of
Momotaro from my video on Momonosuke.

00:11:52.709 --> 00:11:58.810
Here's a quick refresher: It's an old Japanese
story about a boy who on his journey to defeat

00:11:58.810 --> 00:12:04.769
an oni, meets a pheasant a dog, a monkey and
then in the second phase of the story a tiger

00:12:04.769 --> 00:12:06.680
and later on a bull.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:12.250
During this second part, the Monkey picks
up and plasy with a Crab that defends itself.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:18.589
The Dog goes to kill the Crab, and fails to,
instead it can only throw the crab with its

00:12:18.589 --> 00:12:21.540
mouth and knock it unconscious.

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:27.420
Later the crab comes back and attacks the
dog during the final phases of the story of

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:28.420
Momotaro.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:34.029
Now for full disclosure, this is only one
of the many variants of the story, that is

00:12:34.029 --> 00:12:39.310
however particularly prominent in the south
of Japan, where Oda is also from.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:45.300
The order in which each animal appears, corresponds
perfectly with that of each admiral in the

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:46.300
story.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.440
So once we have met admiral green bull.

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:55.320
I believe we will meet admiral orange crab,
who is gonna be none other than coby himself.

00:12:55.320 --> 00:13:00.630
Sound way more reasonable than orange crab
should, am I right?

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.350
I feel the same way.

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:04.950
But it all seems to fit really nicely.

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:06.420
A bit too nicely.

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:12.120
The 2 conflicts between the dog and the crab
might tell us more about this.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:21.899
Let's just go back to this scene her for a
moment []. 

00:13:21.899 --> 00:13:23.850
Coby steps up to Akainu.

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:27.910
A clear clash in morals and codes of justice.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:34.920
Akainu TRIES to kill Coby, but fails, in the
end only knocking him unconscious as shanks

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:40.809
steps in, who uses his shell, his haki to
defend against Akainu's logia abilities.

00:13:40.809 --> 00:13:43.740
A bit too much coincidence don't you think?

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:49.829
And this would also foreshadow a rematch between
Koby and Akainu, this time on the same level.

00:13:49.829 --> 00:13:55.070
Now what we still need to figure out is what
ability Coby might have that would coincide

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:57.230
with the orange theme.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:01.209
If coby becomes an admiral, he needs a fruit
to back it up.

00:14:01.209 --> 00:14:06.340
There is probably more options out there,
but the best one that comes to mind is subscribing

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:10.290
to my channel for next generation anime content.

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:14.920
And the second best is Ace's mera mera no
mi, that is as orange as it gets.

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:21.140
Ace even has a direct connection to Akkainu,
like as direct as it gets.

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:27.100
Now the only problem with this is obviously
that Sabo has already eaten Ace's fruit.

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:36.240
Sabo, who fights with claws, just as a crab.

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:41.360
Now if only there was any sign that Sabo might
not survive and lose the fruits ability to

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:42.800
someone else.

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:46.230
The reverie really turned that idea on its
head for me.

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:50.880
If Sabo was in comparable trouble to Ace,
that might well lead in his death, or who

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.000
knows maybe he has already died.

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:57.750
And who better for Luffy to inherit both of
his brother's wills than Coby?

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:02.730
But hey, that's just a theory, a One Piece
theory.

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:08.120
And, if you want to know why Coby could inherit
Ace's and Sabo's will by eating their fruit,

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:12.370
I strongly recommend you watch exactly that
video, right here.

